# `rift stash` — browse stash entries with their diffs. Still only.
Output docs/images/stash.gif
Require rift

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set FontFamily "RobotoMono Nerd Font"
Set Width 1280
Set Height 800
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "cd /tmp/rift-demo && clear" Enter
Show

Type "rift stash" Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/images/stash.png
Sleep 300ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
